---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — Dreamer Lab"
  description="Dreamer Lab is a creative studio founded by Nicole Gosé — brand strategist, visual storyteller, and creative director who co-creates with a trusted network to bring dreams to life."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <SectionLabel text="ABOUT THE STUDIO" />
    <h1 class="page-headline">a lab for<br />dreamers.</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">
      Dreamer Lab is a creative studio for the people building something worth remembering.
    </p>
  </section>

  <hr class="section-divider" />

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="about-body">
      <p class="about-lead">
        we help dreamers, solopreneurs, <span class="accent-plus">+</span> creators of unique
        experiences reframe how they see themselves and what they offer — then build the brand to match.
      </p>
      <p>
        a brand that increases visibility, builds trust, and makes it easier for the right people to
        find you. one that works as hard as you do. together, we enhance what you've already created —
        visually, strategically, holistically.
      </p>

      <h2>the founder</h2>
      <p>
        Dreamer Lab was founded by <b>Nicole Gosé</b> — brand strategist, visual storyteller, and
        creative director. she works as Founder, Creative, and Collaborator: holding the vision,
        doing the craft, and calling on a trusted network of makers when a project calls for more
        hands than one.
      </p>
      <p>
        that's the "lab" part. some dreams are bigger than a single discipline, so Dreamer Lab is
        built to co-create — bringing the right people together to turn a vision into something real.
      </p>

      <h2>the mission</h2>
      <p>
        when people love what they do and do what they love, it brings a newfound purpose to their
        lives. they begin to live in the frequency of authenticity. that's what raises the vibration
        of this earth — and that's what we're here for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="cyan-rule" />

  <section class="section cta-close">
    <h2 class="handwritten cta-title">let's co-create.</h2>
    <p>if you're building something you believe in, we'd love to hear about it.</p>
    <Button href="/contact">→ start a project</Button>
  </section>
</Base>
